{"id":"vsego","lemma":"всего","pos":"adv","rank":107,"glosses":["in total, in all","only, merely, no more than"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/07/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я хочу всего.","en":"I want it all.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null]},{"text":"Как мы можем избежать всего этого?","en":"How can we avoid all this?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to avoid"},null,null]},{"text":"Я всего лишь маленький мальчик.","en":"I'm just a little boy.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"only, merely, just"},{"g":"little, small"},{"g":"boy"}]},{"text":"Сколько их всего?","en":"How many are there in all?","words":[{"g":"how much, how many"},{"g":"them / their"},null]},{"text":"Прежде всего, я должен сказать это.","en":"First of all, I must say this.","words":[{"g":"before, previously to"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"must, have to"},{"g":"to say, to tell"},{"g":"this / it is"}]}]}